sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Apresentador
    participant D as Docker Compose
    participant W as OptiDrive Web
    participant H as Healthcheck
    participant C as Confluence
    participant J as Jira
    A->>D: docker compose up -d --build
    D->>W: Inicia aplicação
    W->>H: Expõe estado operacional
    A->>H: Valida /health
    A->>W: Ensaia login, garagem, planeamento e social
    A->>C: Mostra relatórios publicados
    A->>J: Mostra backlog/issues concluídas
